{"slug":"urinalysis","title":"尿液檢查：常規尿液分析與 24 小時尿液","subtitle":"Urinalysis(UA), urine specimen collection and 24-hour urine","category":"lab","aliases":["尿液檢查","尿液分析","常規尿液檢查","尿液常規","Urinalysis","UA","Urine routine","尿液試紙","尿比重","Specific gravity","尿液 pH","尿蛋白","蛋白尿","尿糖","糖尿","尿酮","血尿","Hematuria","膿尿","Pyuria","圓柱體","Cast","結晶體","尿液顏色","尿液性狀","中段尿","清潔中段尿","Midstream urine","隨機尿","晨尿","第一次晨尿","24 小時尿液","24 小時尿液收集","24-hour urine","集尿袋","導尿管採尿","尿量","多尿","寡尿","少尿","無尿","夜尿","尿滲透壓","酚紅試驗","PSP"],"dzTags":["尿液異常","血尿","蛋白尿","多尿","寡尿","無尿","頻尿"],"admTags":[],"system":"renal","alsoIn":["fundamentals"],"group":"renal-labs","reviewed":false,"updated":"2026-10-21","references":[{"title":"華杏《實用基本護理學》下冊，第 15 章排泄需要，表 15-2 常規尿液檢查項目(書頁 373–374)","note":"參考值依此表；本頁表格為重新整理"},{"title":"華杏《實用基本護理學》下冊，第 18 章，技術 18-1～18-3 尿液、尿液培養、24 小時尿液檢體收集法(書頁 543–550)","note":"只參考做法，步驟文字為重新撰寫"},{"title":"華杏《內外科護理學》下冊，第 19 章泌尿系統疾病之護理，尿液檢查與表 19-7、19-8(書頁 781–783)","note":"僅作為撰寫參考"}],"chapters":["基護-Ch18出入院護理與檢體收集 > 入院之常規檢體收集 > 尿液檢體收集法（含培養、24小時尿液檢體收集）","內外-Ch10腎臟與泌尿系統疾病 > 腎臟疾病 > 腎臟與泌尿系統評估及檢查","生解-Ch10泌尿系統 > 尿液與下泌尿道"],"intro":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"p","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"尿液是血液經過腎臟過濾與調整後的產物，看尿量、顏色、比重與成分，就能初步判斷腎臟、泌尿道與全身代謝的狀況。本頁整理常規尿液檢查的正常值與異常意義、各種採檢法（中段尿、導尿管、兒童集尿袋、24 小時尿液）；尿液培養的判讀見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"urinary-tract-infection"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"泌尿道感染"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、腎功能抽血見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"renal-function-tests"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎功能檢驗：BUN、肌酸酐、清除率與 eGFR"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、尿液白蛋白見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"uacr"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"尿液白蛋白/肌酸酐比值"}]},{"type":"text","value":"、尿酮見 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-link","properties":{"target":"ketones"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"酮體"}]}]}]},"sections":[{"id":"summary","depth":2,"number":"一、","title":"重點摘要","children":[{"id":"exam-points","depth":3,"number":"(一)","title":"國考常考點","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"ul","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"正常尿液 pH 是 "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"4.5–8.0"}]},{"type":"text","value":"，不是 3.5–4.5；每天尿量約 1,200–1,500 mL；比重 1.010–1.030"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"白血球 20/HPF 是"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"異常"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（泌尿道感染）；葡萄糖 2 mg/dL、蛋白質 5 mg/dL、每天 1,450 mL 都在正常範圍"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"尿中出現"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"圓柱體"}]},{"type":"text","value":"表示"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"腎臟"}]},{"type":"text","value":"疾病，肝病不會；長期嘔吐、飢餓可出現"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"酮體"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"尿液"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"螢光黃色"}]},{"type":"text","value":" → 服用"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"維生素 B 群"}]},{"type":"text","value":"（國考答案寫維生素 B12）；"},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"暗紅色"}]},{"type":"text","value":"且排尿痛 → "},{"type":"element","tagName":"strong","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"尿道結石"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{